      "writtenOn": "2025-01-03T08:31:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That document does not seem to have a single word about the \"Found virtual method with same index as direct method\" error that cen be reported by `DexFileVerifier::CheckIntraClassDataItemMethods()`. (I want to add a similar error for fields.)\n\nThe constraint A14 in that document is also pretty weak. We strictly check that a method name that starts with a `\u003c` is either `\u003cclinit\u003e` or `\u003cinit\u003e`, see `DexFileVerifier::CheckClassDataItemMethod()` error \"Bad method name for method index\".\n\n(Note that this is relevant for https://android-review.googlesource.com/3380108 as well.)",
